# No registry override, and no credentials.
#
# @unerp/* resolves from the workspace while packages/* is still a member, which
# is what keeps CI installable: a runner has no localhost registry, and pinning
# the scope there made every `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` fail.
#
# A committed `_authToken` also lived here. Anyone with repository access could
# reuse it, and it would be copied into every clone and container image. Tokens
# belong in the environment; if a registry override is ever needed, set
# UNERP_REGISTRY and NPM_TOKEN in the environment and let npm expand them —
# never write a secret into a tracked file.

node-linker=hoisted
shamefully-hoist=true
